1. SCOPE

This license covers the original content of this repository: the JSON
schemas under schema/, the code under engine/, scripts/ and tests/, the
documentation under docs/, and the anatomical and biomechanical data
records under data/ — including their selection, structure, arrangement,
identifiers, wording, and the citation apparatus that accompanies them.

Third-party material carries its own terms and is NOT covered by this
license. Any such material is confined to clearly marked directories, each
carrying its own LICENSE file. See docs/GEOMETRY_SOURCES.md for the current
inventory and the attribution obligations that travel with it.


